    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akai a apukan neni epukator Solomon ka ŋaduketa ŋunace",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Solomon toduk akai keŋ a elope ŋikaru ŋitomon ka ŋiuni kiridak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok Solomon akai a apukan a ŋakito a ŋuna a Cedar a ŋuna a Lebanon. Arae aoyau ka akai a ŋin alosepyon ŋimitae ŋatomoniomwon a ŋikanikapei, kiŋaren ka ewae ŋolo iteotor, arae ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei a ŋiuni, ido ameun alokwap tari kidiama arae ŋimitae ŋitomon a ŋiuni ka atutubet. Ayakasi kai ŋin ŋilaino ŋiomwon ŋulu a ŋipirin a Cedar. a ŋololain, ayakasi ŋipirin ŋitomon ka ŋikan, kikacitetei lopirin a Cedar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erapirapitae kidiama a ŋakito a Cedar a ŋuna edokonokinitoe nakito ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋakan ŋuna ekacakina lopirin ŋulu aya nawaetin a akai, ŋulu arae ŋitomon ka ŋikan a ŋololain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arekinitae ŋidirisae ŋilaino ŋiuni amiar kidiama, kiteos ŋolodirisa ka ŋoloce alosyep a ŋoloce ka a ŋololain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi lopukei ka lodirisae ŋakito ŋuna aya ŋiwaetin ŋiomwon ŋulu ariyan alowaetin a ŋulu eteosi ka eteosi ŋilaino a ŋidirisae a ŋulu aya narwatatain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok Solomon akai ŋina arae ŋipirin bon awuar, arae aoyau a akai a ŋin alosepyon ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei a ŋiarei ka kiŋaren ka neni iteotor, arae ŋimitae ŋitomon a ŋiuni ka atutubet. Ayai kiŋaren akai ŋin ebarasan ŋolo arae ŋipirin bon awuar alokiŋaren, ŋolo etolimikinit kiŋaren Akai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok Solomon kai ŋina arae ŋipirin bon awuar akibois ŋina atubeneneo iŋes ŋakiro, anyaritae nen Agule ŋina etubere ŋakiro. Apesitae ŋakito a Cedar kwap nen daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok iŋes akai keŋ a elope ikwaan ka ŋaduketa ŋunace. Adukitoe akai ŋin kaku akibois ŋina atubere ŋakiro. Todukok daŋ iŋes aberu keŋ nakoku a Parao akai ŋina ekwaan ka ŋina keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adukitoe ŋakais ŋun daadaŋ ka akibois ŋina atubere ŋakiro a ŋamoru a ŋuna agogoŋ nooi ameun anakisyakinet arwatata tari nakisalet arwatata alokidiama, atubutubutoe ŋamoru a erigi ipimitae ejok tooma ka kiŋa kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adukunitoe ŋakais ŋun alokwap; anamoru a ŋuna aburok a ŋuna agogoŋ nooi. Arae aoyau a ŋamoru a ŋun a ŋace ŋimitae ŋiomwon ŋace arae ŋimitae ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kidiama ŋamoru ŋun adukokinitae ŋamoru ŋuna agogoŋ nooi ŋuna atubutubutoe ipimitae ejok ka adukokinitae kidiama ŋamoru ŋun ŋakito a Cedar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awuaunit arwatata ŋina adukitoe a ŋamoru alapatu ŋina apolon ŋina alokidiŋ akai. Ameun alokwap tari kidiama arwatata a ŋin, ayakasi ŋamoru ŋauni, ido min akitoe ŋina a Cedar. Epite ŋol adukitere tari alapatu ŋina alokidiŋ Akai ke Ekapolon kaapei ka ebarasan keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iram ŋolo etiyae ŋiboro a ŋasuwa a eburonis",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyarau Solomon Iram alo Tiro, ido kijau iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Iram lokoku ka apuserut a ŋina alokabila a Naputali, arae sek papa keŋ ŋolo alo Tiro, arae iŋes eketiyan ŋiboro a ŋasuwa a ŋuna a eburonis. Ayeni Iram nooi epite ŋolokitiyaet ka aos, ayeni akitiya ŋiboro a ŋasuwa a ŋuna a eburonis. Abu Iram bu neni a Solomon kitiya etic ŋolo amaikina iŋes kitiya daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todupak Iram ŋipirin ŋiarei ŋulu a eburonis, arae aoyau a ŋolopir ŋimitae ŋikanikauni, ido aburis a ŋolopir arae ŋimitae ŋikan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu daŋ iŋes kitiyau ŋakyes a ŋipirin ŋaarei a eburonis, arae aoyau a ŋinakou a epir ŋimitae ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elogakinitae nakou a ŋolopir ŋiriko ŋikanikaarei ŋulu elogilogitae kaapei akisibusya ŋipirin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Iram kiwuak loriko ŋul ŋilaino ŋiarei ŋulu a ŋitorubei a ŋaraito a ekitoe a ŋolo esibit ekacikicikit, akisibusya ŋakyes a ŋipirin. Abu iŋes kitiya ŋun kidiama ŋolopir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eruwor ŋakyes a ŋipirin a ŋulu a ebarasan, abu Iram kitiyau esibit ŋatur a ecomocomo, arae aoyau a ŋakyes a ŋun ŋimitae ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewuakinitae a ŋilaino ŋitorubei ŋamiae ŋaarei ŋulu a pomegranate nakyes a ŋipirin a ŋuluarei a ŋul kidiama neni etiyatae esibit ŋabakulei, kilogilogitetei ŋiriko kiryam cib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosiponok Iram ŋipirin lobarasan a Akai ka Akuj. Tonyara iŋes ekiro a epir a ŋolo ayai lowae ŋolo alo kwap Akai ŋin Yakin, ido ŋolo ayai Kuju Akai ŋin tonyara Boas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayetae ŋakyes a ŋipirin a ŋul esibito ŋatur ŋuna a ecomocomo. Aŋun, abu Iram kirikak etic ŋolo a ŋipirin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
