        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau Iram etorube ka anam a ŋina luluŋ a ŋasuwa a eburonis arae alolomu ŋimitae ŋiomwon ka atutubet ameun alokipitot ke epei tari ŋoloce, ido arae acukul ŋimitae ŋiarei. Arae aoyau a lokipetot akirimokin ŋimitae ŋitomon ka ŋiuni ka atutubet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwap ŋikipetetyo ka anam a ŋin, ewuakinitae ŋitorubei a ŋitwol a ŋul kiryam cib, ŋitwol ŋitomon natutubet a emitae. Arekinitae ŋitorubei a ŋitwol a ŋul lolaino ŋiarei ŋulu aya lokipetot a anam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etowoitae anam ŋin alotorubei a ŋitomon ka ŋiarei a ŋulu a ŋimoŋin, eŋoliyarito ŋimoŋin ŋul ŋiuni Kuju, ŋiuni To, ŋiuni Kwap ka ŋiuni Kide. Arapuwarit anam ŋawat a ŋimoŋin a ŋul ameun alogur tari namuroi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atya abutur ka anam a ŋin akan nenidapal etiyaunitae ŋikelyo a ŋikipetetyo etya ŋulu a ekopo, ikwaan ka akuyon a ecomocomo. Elelebunun nanam ŋin ŋakipi ŋuna a ŋabesenio a ŋalipyo ŋaarei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau daŋ Iram ŋigaari ŋitomon a eburonis, arae aoyau alosepyon a ŋinigaari ŋimitae ŋulu aapiyarito ŋiarei, kiŋaren ka neni iteotor arae ŋimitae ŋulu aapiyarito ŋiarei, ido aoyau alokwap tari kidiama arae emita epei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epite lo iŋes etiyaunitere ŋigaari ŋul: Ayakar ŋinigaari ŋasuwa ŋuna ekamanakina anenilapat a igaari ka alosepyon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ewuanakinitae kidiŋ ŋasuwa a ŋigaari a ŋul ŋitorubei a ŋiŋatunyo a ŋimoŋin ka ŋulu a Ŋikerubim. Ewuanakinitae nasuwa ŋuna alokwap ka ŋuna alokidiama ŋitorubei a ŋiŋatunyo ka ŋulu a ŋimoŋin, aya daŋ nen ŋitorubei ŋulu a ŋakwii ŋulu ayeanakinitae ilugilugitoe ŋasuwa neni iwasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakar ŋinigaari ŋakejen ŋaomwon ŋuna etiyaunitae a eburonis ka ŋasuwa ŋaarei ŋuna erimyoto ŋakejen ŋuna etiyaunitae a eburonis. Aya lokoonae ŋuluomwon a ŋinigaari ŋawoeta ŋuna ka abesen. Ewuakinitae ŋitorubei a ŋakwii nawaetin a ŋawoeta aŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyakinitae tooma ŋinigaari awoet a abesen ŋina luluŋ, ŋina aapiyarit acukul emita. Aluluŋ ŋawoeta ŋun alokidiama, ido aapiyarit alolomu kec alotooma emita. Ecienakinitae ŋinawoet ŋitorubei, ayakatar ŋawoeta ŋiwaetin ŋulu eriyan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi ŋakejen kwap ŋikelyo ŋulu alokwap ŋinigaari erepakinitae ŋigaari ŋasuwa ŋuna irimyoto ŋakejen, ido aapiyarit alolomu a ŋinakeju a igaari emita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyatae ŋakejen ŋun, esibit ŋuna ka agaari a ŋina iritae a ŋaŋolei; ayakasi ŋasuwa ŋuna irimyoto ŋakejen, ayai ŋasuwa ŋun neni luluŋ, aya ŋipagi ka aya ŋaabwa neni eenio ŋipagi alokidiŋ akeju etiyaunitae ŋiboro ŋul daadaŋ a ŋasuwa a ŋuna arae ŋasimito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewuakinitae ŋadaketa ŋaomwon lokoonae ŋuluomwon a ŋinigaari, emiidikinitae ŋadaketa nigaari imorikina erae asuwat apei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayai kidiama igaari neni aeniunit ŋiwaetin daadaŋ, toapiyarite adapalu atutubet a emita. Atapakina ŋawoeta ka ŋikelyo nigaari arae ibore ipei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicieanak Iram ŋitorubei a Ŋisubuna a ŋulu a ŋabebenuk, a ŋiŋatunyo ka ŋulu a ŋikito a ŋiŋolya nawoeta, lokelyo ka neni alapat daadaŋ a nigaari, ido kiwuanak ŋitorubei a ŋakwii kisiryam cib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋol epite ŋolo etiyaunitere ŋigaari ŋulutomon ŋul. Etiyatae ikes daadaŋ a eburonis, ido ariyan alotyae ka ekwaan alopite a ŋolo etiyatere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau Iram ŋabapwa ŋatomon a eburonis; apedoryo akilelebikin ŋinabapu ŋilitae ŋamiae ŋakanikauni a ŋatomonikanikauni, ido aapiyarit alolomu a ŋinabapu ŋimitae ŋiarei; ŋabapwa ŋun ŋunatomon, arae ŋuna a ŋigaari a ŋulutomon, a ŋinigaari abapu apei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak Iram ŋigaari ŋul ŋikan lowae ŋolo alo Kwap Akai ka Akuj, kiwuak ŋikan lowae ŋolo alo Kuju. Kiwuak etorube ŋolo ka anam lokoona ŋolo ayai Kwap-Kide Akai ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ Iram kitiyau ŋabapwa, ŋikitiyoi ka ŋabakulei. Aŋun, abu iŋes kirikak etic daadaŋ ŋolo etiyae alo Kai ke Ekapolon aŋuna a erwosit Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Iram kitiyau ŋipirin ŋuluarei ŋul ka ŋabakulei ŋunaarei ŋun ŋuna ewuakinitae nakyes a ŋipirin a ŋul ta ŋiriko ŋuluarei ŋulu elogilogitae akisibusya ŋabakulei ŋuna ayeanakinitae nakyes a ŋipirin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau Iram ŋitorubei a ŋaraito a ekitoe ŋamiae ŋaomwon akisibusya ŋiriko ŋul ŋiarei, kiwuak ŋilaino ŋiarei ŋulu a ŋitorubei a ŋaraito neni a ŋolorikot akisibusya ŋabakulei ŋuna ayekinitae nakyes a ŋipirin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau Iram ŋigaari ŋitomon ka ŋabapwa ŋatomon ŋuna ewuakinitae kidiama ŋigaari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kitiyau daŋ etorube ka anam epei ka ŋitorubei a ŋimoŋin ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, ewuakinitae ŋitorubei ŋul kwap etorube ka anam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau Iram ŋamoti, ŋikitiyoi ka ŋabapwa. Ŋiboro ŋul daadaŋ ŋulu abu Iram kitiyau aŋuna a Solomon erae ŋulu a Akai a Ekapolon, arae ŋulu etiyaunitae a eburonis a ŋolo epwasitae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi ŋiboro ŋul daadaŋ kitiyaunae anadipo a ŋina a aŋolol Yorodan alokidiŋ Sukos ka Saresan ikwapei alimunitor erwosit Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Solomon kitiyau ŋiboro ŋulu elalak nooi; aŋun, aponi nyeyenun apotis a eburonis, a ŋolo keponi kisitiyae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Solomon kitiyau ŋiboro lu daadaŋ ŋulu aya Kai ke Ekapolon: Namuroet ŋina etiyaunitae a egolid, emesa ŋolo etiyaunitae a egolid ŋolo arae ŋolo a ŋamugati a ŋuna ka ayakau a ŋina a Akuj, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋawoeta a ŋitaae ŋuna etiyaunitae a egolid bon, aya ŋakan lowae ŋolo alo Kwap, ŋakan lowae ŋolo alo Kuju, toya kiŋaren akibois ŋina asegan. Kitiyau a egolid ŋatur, ŋitaae ka ŋasuwa ŋunaridet ŋatotol; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
